{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04718","headline":"赠工部尚书冯公挽歌三首 一 · 张说","name":"赠工部尚书冯公挽歌三首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忠鲠难爲事，平生尽畏途。\n如弦心自直，秀木势恒孤。\n诏葬南陵道，神游北斗枢。\n贵门传万石，余庆在双珠。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04718.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04718","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}